# PlantDoctor local config — copy to .env for local runs (never commit .env).
# The deployed web app talks to the Spring Boot backend at this URL when set;
# when empty, the app runs in its built-in demo mode (curated diagnoses from
# the plant-care library, care schedule fully offline). No Gemini key ever
# belongs in this file.
EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=
# Example: EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=https://plantdoctor-backend.example.com
